<mj-text>
  You can also contribute to the Additional Investment Fund with a recurring payment. This way
  a contribution reaches your child's account every month without you having to think
  about it separately.
</mj-text>
<mj-text>
  <strong>You can set up the recurring payment in your Tuleva account by switching to your
  child's role view.</strong>
</mj-text>
<mj-button href="https://pension.tuleva.ee/savings-fund/payment?language=en&utm_content=nudge_savings_fund_recurring">
  Set up recurring payment
</mj-button>
